    "sourceContract": [
      "Only explicitly offered CLASSIFY_FALSE_POSITIVE / CLASSIFY_CONFIRMED_EXCEPTION / APPEAL_FULLY_UPHELD / APPEAL_PARTIALLY_UPHELD / APPEAL_REJECTED can append reserved outcomes. Generic writer rejects those codes.",
      "Live HR_ADMIN scoped grants, session-only mandatory MFA, tenant capability and historical resource checks are preserved. New writes re-read capability/grants/current scope under the bound per-case advisory lock using ReadCommitted. Tokens remain locators. Exact retry preserves original reason/operation and writes no duplicate row.",
      "Current resolved cycle permits one finding per classification/appeal dimension; reopening invalidates current findings. Classified resolved samples alone form final outcome denominators; unfinished and each dimension's unclassified resolved cases are separate, zero classified sample yields null shares.",
      "CASE_RECORDED_AT cohort and protected repeatable-read report snapshot remain explicit. Linked approved correction evidence remains a separate measure and cannot imply false positive or appeal outcome.",
      "Reason is required3-1000, privately persisted in immutable decision ledger; aggregate report/audit envelope contains no private reason/raw coordinates. Manager allowlist is unchanged and HR outcome actions separate; UI sanitizes enums and uses explicit confirmation/frozen retry reason.",
      "No automated employment decision, tenant activation, grant/secret/access configuration change, or Support product delta. Existing finance-only shared changes are exact approved incoming main."
    ],
    "noHRMRolePrivacyCASE_RECORDED_ATChangesFrom8fc": true,
    "noAutomatedPersonnelDecisionsOrTenantActivation": true
